1) What Role-Based Prompting is, in simple terms.
2) Why it matters when using AI tools like Claude.
3) How assigning a role changes the quality and relevance of AI responses.
4) One sample prompt without a role.
5) One sample prompt with a role.
6) Three practical benefits of Role-Based Prompting (bullet points).

